				<r3d:description language="eng">Most or all of the features are no longer available via the CDS/DL website since provision of the EPSRC UK national Chemical Database Service has been taken over by the Royal Society of Chemistry from 1st January 2013. Daresbury now offers reduced database access, but CrystalWorks developments continue here. 
